  "description": "A small, flexible Task-based coroutine helper designed for legacy and constrained C++ runtimes.\nCortado provides a minimal Task abstraction with pluggable allocators, exception handlers,\natomics and schedulers so you can adopt coroutines without changing your project's runtime.",
